    <briefdescription>
<para>Aggregated coordinator-level metrics for access model operations. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Collects operation counters and latency histograms across the full promotion/demotion pipeline. Thread-safe per-histogram recording via atomic increments in the underlying <ref refid="classthemis_1_1access__model_1_1LatencyHistogram" kindref="compound">LatencyHistogram</ref> buckets. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
